  },
  data: {
    LLM: 'On your turn draw one card, then play one card or discard. Play Roll to drive; play distance cards (25–200 km) when Roll is showing; max two 200 km per hand. Play hazards on opponents; play remedies on your battle/speed area; play safeties for immunity and optional coup-fourré. Discard when no legal play. Hand ends when someone reaches target distance or all cards are played.',
    Player: 'On your turn draw one card, then play one card or discard. Play Roll to drive; play distance cards (25–200 km) when Roll is showing; max two 200 km per hand. Play hazards on opponents; play remedies on your battle/speed area; play safeties for immunity and optional coup-fourré. Discard when no legal play. Hand ends when someone reaches target distance or all cards are played.',
    objective: 'Win a hand by being first to play enough distance cards to reach the target (1000 km in 4- or 6-player team play; 700 km in 2- or 3-player with option to extend to 1000). Win the game by being first to reach 5000 cumulative points.',
    gameplay: 'On your turn draw one card, then play one card or discard. Play Roll to drive; play distance cards (25–200 km) when Roll is showing; max two 200 km per hand. Play hazards on opponents; play remedies on your battle/speed area; play safeties for immunity and optional coup-fourré. Discard when no legal play. Hand ends when someone reaches target distance or all cards are played.',
    keyRules: [
      'Roll (Go) must show in your battle area before you can play distance cards; Right of Way safety waives this.',
      'Speed Limit limits you to 25 and 50 km distance until End of Limit is played.',
      'Each hazard has one remedy and one safety; safeties prevent that hazard for the rest of the hand.',
      'Coup-fourré: play the matching safety when an opponent plays the hazard against you; hazard is removed and you score 300 bonus.',
      'No more than two 200 km cards per player per hand; total distance cannot exceed target.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
    trumpBonusValues: null,
    setup: {
      players: '2, 3, 4, or 6 players. Four or six players form teams of two sharing a tableau.',
      deck: 'Dedicated Mille Bornes deck of 106 cards: 18 hazards, 38 remedies, 4 safeties, 46 distance cards (25, 50, 75, 100, 200 km).',
      equipment: 'Mille Bornes card game (commercial deck).',
      dealing: 'Shuffle and deal six cards to each player. Remainder forms the draw pile; a discard pile forms next to it. Each turn: draw one card from stock, then play one card to tableau or discard one. Hand size stays at six after play.',
    },
    turnFlow: 'On your turn draw one card, then play one card or discard. Play Roll to drive; play distance cards (25–200 km) when Roll is showing; max two 200 km per hand. Play hazards on opponents; play remedies on your battle/speed area; play safeties for immunity and optional coup-fourré. Discard when no legal play. Hand ends when someone reaches target distance or all cards are played.',
    moveValidityConditions: {
      ante: 'This game has no ante or betting.',
